    "title": "Native Works Rattler 230",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">This is a new release lure and is much easier to use after making great refinement to the previous Rattle 3.<br />The body is slimmer and its unique 8 shape slalom action is maintain.<br />Great casting distance.<br />Coating is much more lasting.<br />By changing the weight balance and shape, miss action is reduced and lessen the burden of push back lure.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Triangle structure of specially development.<br />It is effective also for a low active fish.<br /><br />100% handmade in Japan by Mr Kawauchi Kenichi, his lures are exceptional and undoubtly unique.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length 230 mm</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Gr. 120</span></p></li></ul>",
